# --- 2026-09-15: the 23 headline modules' .olean are KEPT (12.4 MB total).
# Acceptance requires the .olean to be newer than its source, so losing them
# costs a full rebuild. They are arm64 + lean4 v4.34.0-rc2 + mathlib
# 1f495c611d05d2215058cd77c7897d625bc3b445 and will NOT load on another
# toolchain or architecture: they are insurance against local loss, never a
